<%# THE FIRST-NAME STEP'S EMPTY-FIELD ERROR, in a browser.

    WHY THIS PAGE EXISTS AND A RENDER TEST DOES NOT COVER IT. The error copy is a
    JS string INSIDE the x-data. A view test can assert the sentence is present in
    that attribute; it cannot assert a user ever SEES it, and it stays green when
    the attribute is syntactically broken - which is exactly how this component
    fails. A stray quote closes the attribute early, Alpine mounts a silent no-op,
    and every element a string assertion looks for is still in the markup. Only a
    browser can tell those two pages apart.

    THE LAB RULE: this page sets up the partial's LOCALS and nothing else. The
    three modes ARE three sets of locals, so all three are the engine partial
    rendered by name.

    THE THIRD CARD CARRIES AN APOSTROPHE ON PURPOSE. empty_error is the first
    host-supplied PROSE to land inside the x-data, and prose is where the quote
    that kills the component comes from. If the escaping is ever dropped, that
    card mounts dead and shows no error at all.

    RENDERED STANDALONE, not inside a modal host, and that is deliberate: the
    empty path never reaches the store. save() returns before it reads props or
    calls finish(), so a host would add a click to open each card and would grade
    the host - which lab/modal_host already does.
%>
<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 space-y-12" x-data>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">First-name step — empty-field error</h1>

  <section data-test="default-card">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">Default — the skippable card</h2>
    <%= render "studio/modals/onboarding/first_name",
               id: "lab-default-first-name" %>
  </section>

  <section data-test="required-card">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">required: true — the gated card</h2>
    <%= render "studio/modals/onboarding/first_name",
               id: "lab-required-first-name", required: true %>
  </section>

  <section data-test="custom-card">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">A host's own copy, apostrophe and all</h2>
    <%= render "studio/modals/onboarding/first_name",
               id: "lab-custom-first-name", required: true,
               empty_error: "We'll need your first name before you continue." %>
  </section>
</main>
